            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kim"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I was prepared to try this and say \"it needs X-Y-Z added to jazz it up\", but boy was I wrong! The ingredients and flavors are so simple--but so delicious. I mean you could add things like a splash of olive oil or some herbs, and they wouldn't hurt a thing--but the salad is also quite nice as-is. It's light, refreshing, and goes well with just about any entree you can think of. Plus, it's really fast and easy to make! Thank you for sharing your recipe!",
